# This repository is the Dimensions Recompiled workspace. Everything in it is
# opt-in: the working folder is ~20 GB of game data, dumps, emulator clones and
# other people's repositories, and none of that belongs here. So ignore the lot
# and name the folders that are ours.
/*

!/.gitignore
!/.gitattributes
!/README.md
!/README-dev.md
!/docs/
!/.github/
!/VERSION
!/RELEASING.md
!/rexlego/
!/rexlego-installer/
!/DimensionsModManager-CLI/

# Submodules. Only the gitlink and .gitmodules are tracked, never their
# contents - but the catch-all above would hide even the gitlink.
!/rexglue-sdk
!/DimensionsModManager
!/DimensionsSaveConverter
!/xexdump/
!/tools/

# Deliberately still out, even though they are ours or ours-adjacent:
#   xenia-canary/            -> NeverCookFirst/Xenia-Seamless-Toypad-Build
#   LegoToypad/              -> harrysof's project, we only ship his release
#   research/, rpcs3-ref/    -> clones of other people's code
#   LD Backups/, xpng/       -> personal backups and artwork scratch
#   NOTES.md, GIT-SETUP.md   -> local working notes, full of machine paths
